  > docs/Makefile:6-8 #7a6c3999b76c
#c25[i3] Executing `make` without arguments defaults to running the `help` target, which delegates to `sphinx-build -M help`.
  > docs/Makefile:11-12 #b30f15b65725
#c26[i4] A catch-all target routes all unknown targets to Sphinx using `sphinx-build -M`, treating `$(O)` as a shortcut for additional options.
  > docs/Makefile:18-19 #e66fb0e51be7
#c27[i3] The script sets SPHINXBUILD to 'sphinx-build' by default if the environment variable is not already defined.
  > docs/make.bat:7-9 #811d12550ff8
